  "description": "A series of CT sets scanned at differing slice thicknesses and exposure parameters of a chest simulating phantom containing lung nodules. It was constructed by an NCI-FDA joint effort to provide data for nodule-detecting CAD processes. Please see the Phantom FDA page to learn more about the images and to obtain any supporting metadata for this collection.",
